# Migration assessment: `OVHcloud`, `Scaleway`, `UpCloud`

- Inventory file: `inventory.json`
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `OVHcloud` snapshot from `https://www.ovhcloud.com/en-ie/public-cloud/prices/`, retrieved 2026-11-14
- Catalog: `Scaleway` snapshot from `https://www.scaleway.com/en/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-13
- Catalog: `UpCloud` snapshot from `https://upcloud.com/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-13

## Comparison

### Summary

| Fit | `OVHcloud` | `Scaleway` | `UpCloud` |
|---|---|---|---|
| direct | 7 | 5 | 5 |
| partial | 1 | 6 | 3 |
| none | 5 | 2 | 5 |
| total | 13 | 13 | 13 |

### Resources

| ID | Category | `OVHcloud` fit | `OVHcloud` best offering | `Scaleway` fit | `Scaleway` best offering | `UpCloud` fit | `UpCloud` best offering |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `shop-assets` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` | direct | `Object Storage` | direct | `Managed Object Storage` |
| `shop-cdn` | `unclassified` | none |  | none |  | none |  |
| `shop-db` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL` | partial | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` |
| `shop-eks` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` | direct | `Kubernetes Kapsule Dedicated` | partial | `Managed Kubernetes Production` |
| `shop-legacy-mysql` | `database.mysql` | direct | `Managed MySQL Multi-node` | partial | `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL High Availability` | direct | `Managed MySQL Multi-node` |
| `shop-orders` | `messaging.queue` | none |  | partial | `Queues` | none |  |
| `shop-orders-dlq` | `messaging.queue` | none |  | partial | `Queues` | none |  |
| `shop-thumbnailer` | `serverless.function` | none |  | direct | `Serverless Functions` | none |  |
| `shop-web-1` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | direct | `Instances` | direct | `Cloud Servers` |
| `shop-web-1-data` | `storage.block` | direct | `Block Storage LUKS` | partial | `Block Storage` | direct | `Block Storage Encrypted` |
| `shop-web-2` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | direct | `Instances` | direct | `Cloud Servers` |
| `shop-web-asg` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` | partial | `Instances` | partial | `Cloud Servers` |
| `shop.example.com` | `unclassified` | none |  | none |  | none |  |

### Blockers on every target

- `shop-cdn`
  - `OVHcloud`: not classified
  - `Scaleway`: not classified
  - `UpCloud`: not classified
- `shop.example.com`
  - `OVHcloud`: not classified
  - `Scaleway`: not classified
  - `UpCloud`: not classified

## `OVHcloud`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 7 |
| partial | 1 |
| none | 5 |
| total | 13 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `shop-assets` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` (tie: `Object Storage 3-AZ`) | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-cdn` | `AWS::CloudFront::Distribution` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |
| `shop-db` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ` | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-eks` | `AWS::EKS::Cluster` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-legacy-mysql` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.mysql` | direct | `Managed MySQL Multi-node` (tie: `Managed MySQL Multi-node 3-AZ`, `Managed MySQL Multi-node Advanced`, `Managed MySQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) | `Managed MySQL Multi-node` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-orders` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue` |
| `shop-orders-dlq` | `AWS::SQS::Queue` | `messaging.queue` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue` |
| `shop-thumbnailer` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `shop-web-1` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-1-data` | `AWS::EC2::Volume` | `storage.block` | direct | `Block Storage LUKS` | `Block Storage LUKS` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-2` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `shop-web-asg` | `AWS::AutoScaling::AutoScalingGroup` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` | `Instances` does not offer `autoscaling`; `Instances` does not offer `zone-high-availability` |
| `shop.example.com` | `AWS::Route53::HostedZone` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |

### Required changes

- `shop-web-asg`: `autoscaling`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

### Blockers

- `shop-cdn`: not classified
- `shop-orders`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
- `shop-orders-dlq`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `messaging.queue`
- `shop-thumbnailer`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `shop.example.com`: not classified

